comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T19:29:20.583Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Production: pm-cli 2026.10.30 GH-1598 adds full native staged records. On 2026.11.4, optional comment/file metadata contains own undefined values; the public SDK repair receipt then differs from its JSON encoding. A new rich native-record regression fails before the fix. Normalize the fresh validation receipt to its JSON-compatible representation, retaining all defined records, clocks and metadata."
  "2026-11-04T19:29:24.214Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Test: GH-1598 fresh staged timestamps are not stable replay identity. Replay assertions now compare every receipt field except values at the native records[].commit_time_fields pointers, while validating each pointer value as a timestamp. Exact record count, patch, native metadata, byte preservation and all 500 sequences remain asserted; the fresh-validation contract is documented."
  "2026-11-04T19:29:27.351Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Test: SDK 2026.10.31 closed-claim cleanup (pm-cli pm-8xgg7i) removes both assignee and claim_principal. The old terminal stale-claim assertion reproduces false vs true on 2026.11.4. Independently assert cleared native ownership, expect no stale-claim finding after close, and retain positive stale live claims and recent-activity coverage."
  "2026-11-04T19:35:01.515Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Production build-tool contract: pm-changelog 2026.10.31 pmc-pending-version-notes now refuses MISSING_REQUESTED_RELEASE when recent version-only daily tags have empty tracker windows. Verified the November 3/4 release commits and empty sections. Changelog generation/check/notes explicitly opt into --include-empty, rendering honest No changes sections while this in-progress fix remains Unreleased."
  "2026-11-04T19:47:33.879Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Targeted final checks pass: mechanical preview and rich staged-record JSON/metadata regression 2/2; post-close stale-claim case 1/1; built, installed git-free TOON/JSON repair command 1/1. Reverting only JSON normalization makes the new regression fail on optional file-note absence. The initial single-file installed-command failure was a missing build prerequisite and passes after npm run build. Typecheck, lint, duplication (0%), docstrings and explicit-empty changelog check pass. All 500 native model sequences are running through linked pm test; full coverage remains pending."
  "2026-11-04T19:56:55.347Z",codex-toolchain-1104,The current README consumer installation now pins host SDK 2026.11.4 and installs the single freshly packed artifact copied into the fresh consumer directory. Versioned historical audit/proof documents remain dated evidence; current dependency declarations stay in package.json.
  "2026-11-04T20:07:56.974Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"The corrected linked model test passes 1/1 with all 500 native SDK sequences (seed 0x51a7e202) in 2022608 ms total. SDK-read state, complete transport round trips, old-request replay identity, document formats, source bytes and native metadata remain asserted. The rich receipt regression still fails with normalization reverted. Full coverage remains queued behind the earlier package suites."
  "2026-11-04T20:16:54.524Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Focused installed public-SDK acceptance passes 2/2 in real isolated npm/Node and Bun consumers on SDK 2026.11.4. The captured artifact SHA-256 is 5479aa6bb673378b64bdfbe8b30aab79c71741efbc7a89dd5125d25a6cde6891. Each verify.mjs probe checks the full receipt JSON round trip, exact one staged record, preserved component/comment/file/created_at metadata, the exact mechanical patch and a byte/name hash of the unchanged source tracker. The artifact and temporary consumers were removed. This is focused changed-path acceptance, not the complete test:install script."
  "2026-11-04T20:23:13.994Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"The rich native-record regression now explicitly round-trips the normalized complete receipt through both JSON and the TOON codec. It passes 1/1 after that assertion, and final typecheck/lint both pass. Output-profile projection is distinguished from the SDK receipt in the compatibility documentation."
  "2026-11-04T21:25:21.902Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Final full gate: nice -n 10 env NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null timeout --signal=TERM --kill-after=10s 1620s npm run coverage exited 0. All 190 tests passed with no skips, failures or cancellations. The unchanged 100% gate reports 32 authored source files: lines/statements 2789/2789, functions 169/169, branches 1394/1394. Full repair model includes all 500 seeded sequences. Targeted regression, independently reverted production normalization, JSON/TOON round trips and focused real npm/Bun captured-package checks retain exact metadata and source-state assertions. Typecheck, lint, duplication 0%, docstrings, changelog check, production audit and publish attestation pass. No confirmed upstream regression. Keep this item in progress for orchestrator verification; release claim after recording."
